<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani bourse to shut for holiday on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Pakistani bourse to shut for holiday on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange will be closed on Thursday for a local religious holiday, a spokesman for the exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
